  - `File Transfer Configuration` -> `#/fxfer-v6/file-transfer-configuration`
  - `File Transfer Tracking` -> `#/fxfer-v6/file-transfer-tracking`
  - `FTP Server Credentials` -> `#/fxfer-v6/ftp-server-credentials`
